rota lap 4345, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears -- it asks for the page nobody answered, and the answer was the room this law is written in: context/ holds TWO_ROOMS.md, its own front door already taught all four register tokens, and 38 of its pages named no room
think Opened with the tool that names its own transcript -- standing_equipment_run.sh --detach -- rather than choosing a path, per the 20260908.113404 row. Verified the transcript was mine by matching its 15 stash detail lines against git stash list read at the open, since a transcript naming this tree agrees on every structural line and differs only in what has happened since.
think Held still on tracked files for the whole cold pass. It closed 196 guards, 193 green, 0 red, 3 gated, tree_moved=no.
think The thread handed me the lap: my own last recommend named context/ as the last unjoined room and said Air's reading points at **Room:** lines, so the register stands free of the lifecycle answer rather than braided into it.
think Measured before judging. Under the roster's own predicate context/ supplies 107 pages and 38 name no room; all 38 sit in context/specs/, and none has a run-on Status, so all 38 can take the second key cleanly.
think Read all 38 bodies and judged each register from the page rather than its title -- 14 checkable, 21 mixed, 3 vision. The dominant honest reading is mixed, because a spec here lands laps at parity pins and names the next lap gated in the same breath.
think The seventh room brings something the six before it did not: a fixtures/ subroom, 8 pages that are inputs a guard reads byte for byte. All 8 pass free today only for lacking a one-clock stamp, so the exclusion changes no reading and closes the trap where the census would ask a plant to name a register.
obs The doorway scan reads doorway pages=1222 with context=99 and fails=3, the ceiling unmoved. The three remaining are the dated testimony on date/ shelves that accrete-never-break keeps exactly as written.
obs The control's reach-count leg caught my own change out loud: readme_excluded=no the moment honest() grew an eighth page. That leg reads a count rather than an absence for exactly this reason, and it worked on the first lap it could.
obs Against myself, and the measurement won. Twelve of my 38 read below B at Field, and I proposed negation as the cause -- a ruling's business is what refuses. The measurement refuted it: mean negative share is 26% for context/specs against 23% for foundations, near-identical. Reach is what parts the rooms, below-80 at 12 of 72 against 5 of 93. A page whose sentences are proper nouns, module names and parity pins meets a grade-level budget drawn for prose that argues.
obs So I rewrote none of the nineteen and put the reading on the card as a third question for gate %7, beside the guided map and the module heads that already fall between two settings. The QA stack is bounded at depth 2 and anything deeper becomes a card line, which is what this is.
obs names-awaiting-confirmation.md read C at Field and A at Meter. That frame closed on a measurement rather than a molt: the page is a ledger of what is not yet settled, refusal is literally its subject, and it carries ten living citers a fresh stamp would strand.
